      <div class="space-y-6 text-[#223e2c] text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed font-normal">

        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          No — You cannot hike on your own when you visit Cheow Lan Lake.<br /> A variety of wildlife live in the dense rainforest. It can therefore be dangerous for inexperienced visitors. You must have a local guide for all treks, ensuring both safety and ecological protection.
        </p>
      </div>

      
    </div>
  </article>
